  "body": "* Two double bedrooms with built-in wardrobes\r\n* Modernised interior, including kitchen & bathroom\r\n* Short, flat walk to Browns Bay beach & village shops, supermarkets, cafes, restaurants & public transport\r\n* Cross lease title, no body corporate\r\n* One off-street carpark (non-designated)\r\n\r\nWhether you are taking your first step onto the property ladder, downsizing, or looking for a solid investment, this sunny, upper level unit, with minimal upkeep and no body corporate fees (cross lease title), is a very smart buy. Our motivated vendors are clear: this property is seriously for sale. \r\n\r\nTucked away in a private position just moments from Browns Bay beach and village centre, it's hard to beat this combination of sun, lifestyle, and convenience - all wrapped up in one tidy package. \r\n\r\nThe open-plan living, dining and kitchen create a relaxed, easy-going vibe, filled with natural light. Two double bedrooms provide flexibility for guests, flatmates, or a home office, while the modernised kitchen keeps things functional and fuss-free. A classic, solid unit in a convenient, central Browns Bay location. With a non-designated carpark, you can leave the car at home, with public transport almost on your doorstep. Flat walk to the beach, grab coffee, groceries or dinner nearby. \r\n\r\nCurrently tenanted, this low-maintenance home is ready for new ownership. \r\nCome along to the open homes, or contact us now to arrange a private viewing. \r\n\r\nProperty documentation can be downloaded from: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/9MAJ\r\nAgent conjunctionals welcome from day one.",
